ZCL_COMMAND_READY_COMMAND(
    "metaverse.space.scout.run", "metaverse.space.scout", "",
    "Run one exactly planned bounded read-only space scout mission",
    "Requires confirm:true and the exact stateless plan token. The scout may "
    "read or discover signed manifests and follow permitted portal roots until "
    "the first hard cap. Every network lookup uses the mission's monotonic "
    "deadline and existing generic POINTER/PROVIDER transport. It records a "
